", "Timetrial", "RTA", "\u30bf\u30a4\u30e0\u30a2\u30bf\u30c3\u30af", "\u30ec\u30c8\u30ed"], "long_description": "This game is\nUse dash and jump to reach the goal.\nto reach the goal of the stage.\njumping action game.\n\n\nOperation Description\nLStick(Left/Right)     \n-Move\u3000\u3000\n\nLStick(Left/Right) +Hold B\n-Dash\u3000\n\nA Button\n-Jump\n\n------------------------\n\nStory\nThe orb that brings peace to the world has been stolen by an evil dragon!\n\nThe heroes are now\nTo reclaim the orb!", "short_description": "Use your jumping and dashing skills to reach the goal of the stage!\n\nAn old-fashioned\n2D style jumping action game!\n\nThe game features a variety of unique stages, \nincluding beach, Japanese style, and ice world.\n\nThe game is simple, yet deep.\nchallenging stages await you!\n\nLet's go on a journey into the 2D world!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://saivrgames.blogspot.com/2021/08/2dlike-adventure.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "MaSaitoh", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://saivrgames.blogspot.com/2021/08/about-2dlike-adventure.html", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "ARCADE", "CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ja"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8797009973720792"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210884_863684264265496_3745722373078314678_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IAUF1StEOHAQ7kNvwENn0-M&_nc_oc=AdrketLcmNNFGBUKtPwGnfEsVYyHhtvRiiWL2VLaeS9oXjdUeDFvr556g7Vyk5xjplM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_0yWsh4sS-LxpBC6UoNsUGr3OTBKEh5FZtmKCVbKioBA&oe=6A281E55"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "2DLike Adventure", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Action", "id": "459781504968480"}, {"topic_name": "Arcade", "id": "1592192974313489"}], "release_date": 1629766811, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "4038493579600416", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "4171680576253778", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "873665213588557"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "522110672338810", "locale": "ja_JP", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "2DLike Adventure", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\u3053\u306e\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u306f\n\u30c0\u30c3\u30b7\u30e5\u3084\u30b8\u30e3\u30f3\u30d7\u3092\u99c6\u4f7f\u3057\u3066\n\u30b9\u30c6\u30fc\u30b8\u306e\u30b4\u30fc\u30eb\u3092\u76ee\u6307\u3057\u3066\u3044\u304f\n\u30b8\u30e3\u30f3\u30d7\u30a2\u30af\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\n\n\u64cd\u4f5c\u8aac\u660e\n\nLStick(\u5de6\u53f3)\u3000\n-\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u30e4\u30fc\u79fb\u52d5\u3000\u3000\n\nLStick(\u5de6\u53f3)+B\u30dc\u30bf\u30f3\u62bc\u3057\u3063\u3071\u306a\u3057\u3000\n-\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u30e4\u30fc\u30c0\u30c3\u30b7\u30e5\u79fb\u52d5\u3000\n\nA\u30dc\u30bf\u30f3\n-\u30b8\u30e3\u30f3\u30d7\n\n------------------\n\u30b9\u30c8\u30fc\u30ea\u30fc\n\u4e16\u754c\u306b\u5e73\u548c\u3092\u3082\u305f\u3089\u3059\u30aa\u30fc\u30d6\u304c\u60aa\u306e\u30c9\u30e9\u30b4\u30f3\u306b\u596a\u308f\u308c\u305f\uff01\n\n\u52c7\u8005\u304c\u4eca\u3001\n\u30aa\u30fc\u30d6\u3092\u53d6\u308a\u623b\u3059\u305f\u3081\u306b\n\u3042\u306a\u305f\u3068\u5171\u306b\u65c5\u7acb\u3061\u307e\u3057\u305f\uff01", "short_description": "\u30b8\u30e3\u30f3\u30d7\u3084\u30c0\u30c3\u30b7\u30e5\u3092\u99c6\u4f7f\u3057\u3066\u30b9\u30c6\u30fc\u30b8\u306e\u30b4\u30fc\u30eb\u3092\u76ee\u6307\u305b\uff01\n\n\u6614\u61d0\u304b\u3057\u3044\u3001\n2D\u98a8\u30b8\u30e3\u30f3\u30d7\u30a2\u30af\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u304c\u767b\u5834\uff01\n\n\u30d3\u30fc\u30c1\u3001\u548c\u98a8\u3001\u6c37\u306e\u4e16\u754c\u306a\u3069\u500b\u6027\u8c4a\u304b\u306a\u30b9\u30c6\u30fc\u30b8\u3001\n\u30b7\u30f3\u30d7\u30eb\u306a\u304c\u3089\u3082\u5965\u6df1\u3044\u3001\n\u601d\u308f\u305a\u71b1\u4e2d\u3057\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3046\u96e3\u6613\u5ea6\u306e\u30b9\u30c6\u30fc\u30b8\u304c\u3042\u306a\u305f\u3092\u5f85\u3064\uff01\n\n\u3055\u3042\u30012D\u98a8\u306e\u4e16\u754c\u306b\u65c5\u306b\u51fa\u3088\u3046\uff01"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "transerogo.png", "id": "532373978016467", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035454_532373981349800_5940232288632359337_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LWRRCQVnEdYQ7kNvwEW_yCG&_nc_oc=Ado1_rdyXcNju4Oex8KnY33kOkn1NpQEVkUSPNz92TgSob7BYHXgQvEqFH-7QKBSc70&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_BqfYdOqYn8dhW4yLRtlxucskEkarK8J-XaEa_5uPziQ&oe=6A280F38"}, {"file_name": "yyoko.png", "id": "875097223359871", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974759_875097226693204_5800282339439131436_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kAKWqgD0_nMQ7kNvwGy5ReD&_nc_oc=Adr0ns9Yht5lrQLylC5tL66tnhiO9JCMCyjZw6CsPf7LG2F